{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Diary is a convenient program for creating and maintaining a personal game diary. It allows you to store information about your games, keep notes with the ability to format text and insert images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features of the program:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add games to a personal list with the status of the passage: &quot;Planning&quot;, &quot;In progress&quot;, &quot;Completed&quot;, &quot;Abandoned&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit notes with text formatting (bold, italics, underline), the ability to insert screenshots and other images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible sorting and quick search for games in the list.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient and intuitive interface with support for dark mode for comfortable use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in statistics showing the total number of games and the number of games for each status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations of interface elements for a more pleasant user experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Diary is an ideal solution for players who want to conveniently organize their gaming memories and plans in one place.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810140?t=1753882722","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810140?t=1753882722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810140/54faa7c92f9269c634279a8283aa9825ff86a48e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753882722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810140/54faa7c92f9269c634279a8283aa9825ff86a48e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753882722","categories":[{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Diary is a convenient program for creating and maintaining a personal game diary. It allows you to store information about your games, keep notes with the ability to format text and insert images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features of the program:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add games to a personal list with the status of the passage: &quot;Planning&quot;, &quot;In progress&quot;, &quot;Completed&quot;, &quot;Abandoned&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit notes with text formatting (bold, italics, underline), the ability to insert screenshots and other images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible sorting and quick search for games in the list.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient and intuitive interface with support for dark mode for comfortable use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in statistics showing the total number of games and the number of games for each status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations of interface elements for a more pleasant user experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Diary is an ideal solution for players who want to conveniently organize their gaming memories and plans in one place.</p></li></ul>","developers":["SugarCane"],"dlc":[3852350],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810140/6cfe8bf2803dbfd4a825870b0527ed79b893f102/header.jpg?t=1753882722","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810140/872421369/687629591b4767d9aade051eebee1f2183da19b0/1752513994/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752675286","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3810140/872421369/687629591b4767d9aade051eebee1f2183da19b0/1752513994/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752675286","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor